# 只发布源码和项目复刻资料。
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/code/
!/plan/
/plan/*
!/plan/bom.xlsx
!/plan/task.md
!/plan/procurement.md
!/plan/design/
/plan/design/*
!/plan/design/wiring.md
!/plan/design/functions/
/plan/design/functions/*
!/plan/design/functions/F*.md

# Agent指令与内部工作资料不进入仓库。
AGENTS.md
AGENTS.override.md
agent.md
registry.md
**/.agents/
**/.codex/

# 构建产物与机器配置。
code/Build/
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.idea/
**/local.properties
*.o
*.obj
*.elf
*.axf
*.hex
*.bin
*.map
*.lst
*.log
~$*
.env
*.jks
*.keystore
# 固件交付包应按冻结流程明确管理，不依赖本地编译产物提交。
